WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:04.940
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:00.980 --> 00:02.960
Kannazuki no Miko

00:02.961 --> 00:04.940
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:06.600 --> 00:10.470
That person was lingering
in the spring sunlight.

00:11.980 --> 00:16.820
With a beautiful form, like an angel
descending on a flower garden.

00:18.550 --> 00:19.890
Wait!

00:20.850 --> 00:24.000
Beautiful, black hair
that waves with the wind.

00:22.320 --> 00:24.000
Hey, wait! Wait!

00:26.210 --> 00:28.450
Nice, slender limbs.

00:29.630 --> 00:34.810
Her eyes that resemble the
deepness of a mystic lake...

00:30.530 --> 00:31.860
Hey!

00:36.170 --> 00:40.380
were just looking straight at me.

00:43.570 --> 00:47.949
Being in that gaze, my
heart began to race...

00:47.950 --> 00:51.890
and my chest was filled with
such shock and amazement...

00:52.280 --> 00:55.240
that it was difficult for me to breathe.

01:01.590 --> 01:05.090
This was Chikane-chan's and my meeting.

01:06.200 --> 01:07.930
A destined meeting.

01:34.820 --> 01:38.885
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

01:38.886 --> 01:42.949
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

01:42.950 --> 01:46.015
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:46.016 --> 01:49.079
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:49.080 --> 01:51.210
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:51.840 --> 01:53.610
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:53.611 --> 01:55.379
Surely my existence is here now

01:55.380 --> 01:57.090
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:57.093 --> 01:58.425
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:58.426 --> 01:59.759
There's no more tears to cry

01:59.760 --> 02:01.885
tada dakiaeru shunkan

02:01.886 --> 02:04.010
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

02:04.470 --> 02:06.620
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

02:06.621 --> 02:08.770
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

02:08.980 --> 02:11.420
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

02:11.421 --> 02:13.859
Flowing towards the other side of time,

02:13.860 --> 02:16.195
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

02:16.196 --> 02:18.530
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

02:18.820 --> 02:21.010
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

02:21.011 --> 02:23.199
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

02:23.200 --> 02:27.495
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

02:27.496 --> 02:31.790
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

02:42.790 --> 02:44.890
I'm going to Tokyo?

02:45.130 --> 02:47.429
My uncle seems to be ill.

02:47.430 --> 02:50.900
And my father is busy
with his new business.

02:51.570 --> 02:56.110
I want someone that can handle
the household like you to help him.

02:57.040 --> 02:58.539
T-To Tokyo?

02:58.540 --> 03:00.949
To leave you?

03:00.950 --> 03:01.950
Yes.

03:02.510 --> 03:03.909
I...

03:03.910 --> 03:05.770
I have a bad feeling.

03:06.180 --> 03:08.830
I know since I've worked here for years.

03:09.220 --> 03:12.650
Ojousama is planning to go somewhere alone.

03:12.890 --> 03:16.840
Somewhere far away where
I'll never see her again.

03:17.190 --> 03:18.460
Otoha-san.

03:19.460 --> 03:23.760
I'm comfortable having you
take care of my uncle.

03:24.640 --> 03:26.100
Can you do it?

03:27.970 --> 03:30.475
Eighth Episode

03:30.476 --> 03:32.980
Storm of the Silver Moon

03:51.200 --> 03:54.430
Otoha-san, the car is ready.

04:04.580 --> 04:05.750
Otoha-san?

04:06.040 --> 04:11.130
This tree was here when I
came here ten years ago.

04:11.620 --> 04:16.850
That day, I met you for the
first time under this tree.

04:17.460 --> 04:25.370
You looked very relaxed with the
bright sunlight shining on you.

04:25.830 --> 04:27.259
That's right.

04:27.260 --> 04:31.240
I enjoyed looking at the
world from atop this tree.

04:31.670 --> 04:35.960
So much so that I couldn't stop,
even though I was told not to.

04:36.670 --> 04:40.720
I couldn't do anything at those times.

04:41.150 --> 04:44.200
All I could do was look up at you.

04:44.520 --> 04:49.960
But there was just one time when
I tried to climb up with you.

04:50.650 --> 04:53.890
But I got stuck in the middle of it.

04:54.160 --> 04:57.020
Consequently, it caused a lot of trouble.

04:57.700 --> 05:03.410
It was since that day that you
never climbed this tree again.

05:04.340 --> 05:06.030
Was that so?

05:06.220 --> 05:07.380
Yes.

05:08.040 --> 05:09.260
I...

05:09.970 --> 05:15.480
I loved how you smiled with
great pride up on this tree.

05:16.210 --> 05:17.979
I really loved...

05:17.980 --> 05:22.260
how you proudly gazed as if
watching the earth from the sky.

05:22.620 --> 05:26.789
And I wanted to climb up
next to you someday...

05:26.790 --> 05:29.870
and see the same view.

05:30.330 --> 05:31.550
Yet...

05:32.800 --> 05:34.450
In the end...

05:34.770 --> 05:40.750
I did nothing but watch you
ponder and make decisions alone.

05:41.770 --> 05:46.739
Although I was assigned to be your
maid for the past ten years...

05:46.740 --> 05:49.620
all I did was look up at you.

05:50.510 --> 05:52.849
I'm very sorry, Ojousama.

05:52.850 --> 05:55.989
I couldn't support you in any way.

05:55.990 --> 05:57.369
Otoha-san.

05:57.370 --> 06:01.059
I'm who I am now because you supported me.

06:01.060 --> 06:05.059
Because you were always
looking out for me...

06:05.060 --> 06:07.170
I was able to be myself.

06:07.770 --> 06:08.899
But...

06:08.900 --> 06:10.990
Thank you, Otoha-san.

06:11.440 --> 06:12.500
Thank you.

06:13.500 --> 06:16.270
Chikane-sama... Chikane-sama...

06:17.270 --> 06:18.350
Chikane...

06:19.080 --> 06:20.490
Chikane-sama...

06:29.450 --> 06:30.870
Ojousama...

06:42.040 --> 06:43.459
S-Sensei!

06:43.460 --> 06:46.509
This is impossible! Let's turn back!

06:46.510 --> 06:48.380
Then you can go back.

06:48.590 --> 06:50.010
N-No way!

06:50.310 --> 06:53.209
I must find out, no matter what.

06:53.210 --> 06:55.010
No matter what.

06:55.610 --> 06:57.010
For his sake!

06:58.620 --> 07:00.520
So it was because of this.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.349
So what?

07:02.350 --> 07:03.860
I'll protect Kurusugawa.

07:04.520 --> 07:07.170
I made a promise.

07:10.730 --> 07:14.699
"Hitomo naki kuni mo
aranuga aragi no koto."

07:14.700 --> 07:17.730
"Tazusae ikite taguite yoran."

07:18.770 --> 07:22.039
Isn't there a world where no one exists?

07:22.040 --> 07:24.730
I'd like to live there with you.

07:25.010 --> 07:27.550
Just sitting quietly by your side.

07:27.980 --> 07:29.290
By your side...

07:37.890 --> 07:39.260
Chikane-chan.

07:41.060 --> 07:42.060
Huh?

07:45.200 --> 07:46.200
Kurusugawa.

07:47.970 --> 07:49.570
Oogami-kun.

07:53.670 --> 07:56.870
I see. Himemiya isn't coming today?

07:57.080 --> 08:00.909
She said she was busy
with the student council.

08:00.910 --> 08:06.149
And since Otoha-san left for Tokyo,
Chikane-chan's handling the household.

08:06.150 --> 08:08.989
So I didn't feel like packing a lunch.

08:08.990 --> 08:11.589
But you should still eat lunch.

08:11.590 --> 08:12.420
Yeah.

08:12.421 --> 08:14.389
Kurusugawa.

08:14.390 --> 08:15.590
Sorry about the other day.

08:16.720 --> 08:21.310
Um, well, anyway, I'm at
fault for the other day.

08:23.570 --> 08:25.970
I... Kurusugawa...

08:26.440 --> 08:29.200
I didn't mean to make you cry.

08:29.840 --> 08:30.840
But...

08:30.870 --> 08:34.179
No, you didn't do anything wrong.

08:34.180 --> 08:38.320
I don't really understand
why I did that, either.

08:39.080 --> 08:41.580
Tears just started to pour out.

08:42.090 --> 08:43.090
So...

08:43.460 --> 08:44.330
So...

08:44.331 --> 08:47.989
A-Anyway, it's not your fault.

08:47.990 --> 08:52.210
It doesn't bother me at all
anymore, so don't you worry.

08:52.660 --> 08:54.290
Not at all?

08:55.030 --> 08:56.199
What?

08:56.200 --> 08:57.769
Nothing.

08:57.770 --> 09:01.309
By the way, you're in the same
class as Chikane-chan, right?

09:01.310 --> 09:02.560
Yeah, why?

09:02.870 --> 09:05.940
Was she different in any way?

09:06.680 --> 09:08.179
Himemiya?

09:08.180 --> 09:10.910
It may just be me...

09:11.220 --> 09:15.040
But she doesn't look like her usual self...

09:15.590 --> 09:19.120
so I'm wondering if
something bad happened.

09:21.190 --> 09:25.699
The one closest to her is saying that,
so there might be something.

09:25.700 --> 09:27.159
But I wouldn't...

09:27.160 --> 09:28.730
You're right.

09:29.170 --> 09:31.590
Why not ask her directly?

09:31.870 --> 09:34.069
Y-Yeah, but...

09:34.070 --> 09:38.680
There might be a reason why
she doesn't want to tell me.

09:39.010 --> 09:40.300
If that's the case, I
probably shouldn't ask her.

09:39.050 --> 09:39.180
Student Council

09:40.540 --> 09:42.679
If that's the case, I
probably shouldn't ask her.

09:42.680 --> 09:44.680
I don't think so.

09:45.020 --> 09:49.570
If it were Otoha-san, I'm sure
she'd know without having to ask.

09:49.890 --> 09:51.570
But me...

09:51.890 --> 09:54.959
S-Sorry, what am I saying?

09:54.960 --> 09:56.689
I'm weird. Forget it.

09:56.690 --> 10:00.499
Kurusugawa, do you have time after school?

10:00.500 --> 10:02.790
If so, I want to take you somewhere.

10:05.900 --> 10:08.509
Y-You don't have to do this.

10:08.510 --> 10:10.469
I can take the bus.

10:10.470 --> 10:12.079
Don't be modest.

10:12.080 --> 10:15.260
If you want, we can go by robot.

10:32.360 --> 10:34.900
Oh, Reiko-sensei's new book.

10:35.730 --> 10:37.029
Is that good?

10:37.030 --> 10:39.930
Yeah, I love it.

10:41.670 --> 10:44.180
I'm sorry, Reiko-sensei.

10:44.810 --> 10:45.880
Hey.

10:53.210 --> 10:57.749
U-Um, can we get names engraved in this?

10:57.750 --> 10:59.419
Yes, you can.

10:59.420 --> 11:02.159
With a small birthstone etched in.

11:02.160 --> 11:03.629
Birthstone...

11:03.630 --> 11:06.859
Um, please engrave it with "Himeko."

11:06.860 --> 11:08.810
Sure, and your boyfriend there?

11:09.770 --> 11:11.860
Um, not for him.

11:12.370 --> 11:13.979
For Chikane-chan.

11:13.980 --> 11:17.570
C-Chikane-chan? Isn't that a girl's name?

11:17.840 --> 11:18.840
Yes.

11:19.470 --> 11:22.910
Okay, for Himeko-chan and
Chikane-chan, right?

11:49.140 --> 11:51.039
I'm sorry, Oogami-kun.

11:51.040 --> 11:54.419
I was preoccupied with
Chikane-chan's present.

11:54.420 --> 11:56.909
I'm glad you found a nice one.

11:56.910 --> 12:01.400
Was it opal and tourmaline?
Do they have some meaning?

12:01.660 --> 12:07.619
Yes, Chikane-chan told me once
that tourmaline, October's birthstone...

12:07.620 --> 12:14.270
means joy, diligence, conquering
sorrow, and becoming happy.

12:14.640 --> 12:16.000
Sure makes me jealous.

12:17.200 --> 12:20.739
No, Souma-kun, Chikane-chan and I...

12:20.740 --> 12:21.740
I understand.

12:22.470 --> 12:25.760
Though I don't know Himemiya like you do...

12:26.060 --> 12:29.430
when she played piano in
front of the whole school...

12:29.680 --> 12:33.100
and when we played a
full set tennis match...

12:35.050 --> 12:39.190
I noticed that she doesn't
consider wins or losses...

12:39.770 --> 12:46.459
but fights alone for her
own sake and her own reasons.

12:46.460 --> 12:49.660
That's why she keeps shining.

12:50.100 --> 12:54.710
Yes, she's always strong,
beautiful, and kind.

12:54.970 --> 12:57.730
Yet she's not bossy to anyone.

12:58.280 --> 13:03.149
She took my frightened hand
and showed me various worlds.

13:03.150 --> 13:05.970
She opened my eyes to many fun things.

13:06.090 --> 13:10.019
She was the first to
compliment my pictures.

13:10.020 --> 13:11.319
That's why I...

13:11.320 --> 13:16.230
No, not just me. I think it's why
everybody loves Chikane-chan.

13:16.560 --> 13:18.440
I love you more.

13:19.400 --> 13:21.500
O-Oogami-kun!

13:26.100 --> 13:27.199
Sensei.

13:27.200 --> 13:33.380
If my guess is correct, the root
of the problem is much deeper.

13:33.880 --> 13:38.210
Not a misreading of the legend
but something about them.

13:40.020 --> 13:41.689
This is...

13:41.690 --> 13:43.260
It can't be...

13:48.840 --> 13:50.839
Thanks for today.

13:50.840 --> 13:52.459
No need for thanks.

13:52.460 --> 13:56.669
Just hurry and give her that.
You bought it for her, right?

13:56.670 --> 13:58.069
Yes. See you.

13:58.070 --> 13:59.610
Yes. See you. Whoa, you forgot this.

14:01.240 --> 14:02.570
You like it, right?

14:03.940 --> 14:05.739
See you tomorrow.

14:05.740 --> 14:07.780
Souma-kun! Souma-kun!

14:08.200 --> 14:10.370
Thank you! See you tomorrow!

14:10.650 --> 14:11.880
Yeah!

14:13.380 --> 14:17.000
We finally parted with a smile.
Good job for me.

14:22.790 --> 14:26.290
Lambs of this world of hell.

14:26.630 --> 14:29.499
Death shall be your shepherd.

14:29.500 --> 14:34.369
The righteous one will be walking
on that when morning comes...

14:34.370 --> 14:37.769
and hell will devour
the once-holy figure.

14:37.770 --> 14:39.269
I'm home.

14:39.270 --> 14:41.810
Huh? No one's home?

14:42.050 --> 14:43.610
Chikane-chan?

14:43.880 --> 14:45.280
Chikane-chan?

14:47.850 --> 14:50.820
Upstairs? Chikane-chan, are you up there?

14:53.820 --> 14:55.290
Is that you?

15:02.580 --> 15:05.090
Chikane-chan, why are you wearing those?

15:05.360 --> 15:09.039
Were we supposed to practice
Shinto prayers today?

15:09.040 --> 15:12.970
Besides, that's my priestess outfit, right?

15:13.230 --> 15:14.250
Himeko.

15:15.280 --> 15:17.220
Do you love me?

15:17.650 --> 15:19.149
Do you?

15:19.150 --> 15:20.719
Well, do you?

15:20.720 --> 15:21.810
I do.

15:22.000 --> 15:24.020
Oh, I'm glad.

15:24.280 --> 15:28.359
Oh, I have something I wanted to give you.

15:28.360 --> 15:31.229
See? I got matching ones.

15:31.230 --> 15:34.780
The sun is mine, and the moon is yours.

15:35.040 --> 15:39.000
Oh, but maybe you should have the sun...

15:40.970 --> 15:43.000
Chikane-chan...

15:43.810 --> 15:46.539
I've had enough of this childish act.

15:46.540 --> 15:49.690
I'm tired of this childish play.

15:50.380 --> 15:51.720
Chikane-chan?

15:59.240 --> 16:04.029
What's this sensation? This
awkward feeling I've never felt.

16:04.030 --> 16:06.730
Is this because of Orochi, too?

16:07.760 --> 16:08.760
Himeko!

16:24.850 --> 16:28.789
Himeko, your lips are so sweet.

16:28.790 --> 16:31.189
Chikane-chan, why?

16:31.190 --> 16:32.380
I've become...

16:32.620 --> 16:34.010
an Orochi.

16:37.830 --> 16:40.229
To do what I want.

16:40.230 --> 16:43.019
What, Chikane-chan? What are you saying?

16:43.020 --> 16:44.770
I don't understand!

16:47.300 --> 16:49.439
No! Chikane-chan, no!

16:49.440 --> 16:50.530
Stop!

16:55.280 --> 16:56.280
Himeko...

16:56.610 --> 16:58.980
I've always wanted this.

16:59.550 --> 17:01.819
A night for you and me.

17:01.820 --> 17:04.919
An eternal night in which I caress you.

17:04.920 --> 17:10.130
I don't want it to end
yet, so please stay quiet.

17:10.400 --> 17:13.380
No... Why'd you become an Orochi?

17:13.680 --> 17:15.110
No!

17:16.300 --> 17:19.140
Is it my fault? Is it my fault?

17:19.400 --> 17:22.639
Is it because I did something
wrong, Chikane-chan?

17:22.640 --> 17:24.140
You want to know why?

17:25.280 --> 17:27.179
You do, don't you?

17:27.180 --> 17:29.440
But I won't tell you.

17:30.480 --> 17:32.190
No!

17:32.510 --> 17:34.070
No!

17:35.320 --> 17:37.680
I love you, Himeko.

17:38.120 --> 17:39.449
No!

17:39.450 --> 17:41.350
No!

17:43.730 --> 17:45.120
Himeko!

17:45.520 --> 17:46.520
Himeko!

17:46.730 --> 17:47.710
Himeko!

17:47.711 --> 17:49.040
Himeko!

17:56.440 --> 17:58.979
You're rather late...

17:58.980 --> 18:00.840
Oogami Souma-kun.

18:01.380 --> 18:02.850
What did you do?

18:03.150 --> 18:06.919
Himeko truly loved you
and worried about you.

18:06.920 --> 18:10.619
Even today, she was looking
for a gift for you.

18:10.620 --> 18:12.110
And you do this to her?

18:12.590 --> 18:16.549
It's none of your business. It's a secret.

18:16.550 --> 18:19.369
What did you do, Himemiya? Answer me!

18:19.370 --> 18:20.999
I told you, right?

18:21.000 --> 18:23.580
All men are prohibited from this house.

18:24.000 --> 18:26.739
Unwelcome guests need to leave.

18:26.740 --> 18:28.120
Stop it!

18:33.140 --> 18:36.109
What is this power? Orochi's power?

18:36.110 --> 18:38.880
What are you doing? You're so weak.

18:39.220 --> 18:42.650
You said that you'd protect
her, but look at you.

18:43.520 --> 18:47.260
Oogami Souma-kun, I wonder what you are.

18:47.640 --> 18:49.690
Not an Orochi that kills priestesses...

18:50.100 --> 18:52.979
nor a knight that
protects your dear princess.

18:52.980 --> 18:55.260
Such a useless existence.

18:55.700 --> 18:59.490
So just disappear from our sight.

18:59.810 --> 19:04.609
Stop this. Even if you're an Orochi,
I don't want to hurt you, Himemiya!

19:04.610 --> 19:06.110
Why, thank you.

19:23.720 --> 19:25.180
What are you doing?

19:25.600 --> 19:29.430
Don't try too hard. Why not
summon your other self?

19:29.730 --> 19:31.269
Please stop.

19:31.270 --> 19:33.810
If I hurt you, Himeko will be sad.

19:34.240 --> 19:37.159
I don't want to see Himeko like that!

19:37.160 --> 19:39.070
You're still saying that?

19:39.320 --> 19:42.030
Please don't make me get serious.

19:42.250 --> 19:45.320
You're too good-natured.

19:45.920 --> 19:49.310
Just who do you think made you so strong?

19:49.910 --> 19:52.489
Why don't you think back again?

19:52.490 --> 19:55.420
Who was with you when you fought?

20:00.730 --> 20:02.550
Then this power...

20:04.430 --> 20:06.800
You never noticed that?

20:07.240 --> 20:08.890
Then I'll show you.

20:09.270 --> 20:11.500
How great your power is.

20:29.000 --> 20:31.000
Don't come! Don't come!

20:31.330 --> 20:33.369
Don't come! Stop!

20:33.370 --> 20:35.380
How rude. Kneel!

20:36.830 --> 20:38.600
On your knees now!

20:44.610 --> 20:45.970
That's good.

20:46.510 --> 20:50.320
Now, transform into the form
you truly wish to have.

20:50.700 --> 20:53.940
To the form you're supposed to
have as a servant of Orochi.

21:05.260 --> 21:06.559
I see.

21:06.560 --> 21:10.450
You're called Take no Yamikazuchi.

21:12.000 --> 21:15.529
I'll take it with me, Souma-kun.

21:15.530 --> 21:18.250
What's that, Himemiya?

21:18.810 --> 21:22.130
You don't need to take
part in this anymore!

21:26.920 --> 21:28.310
Himeko...

21:30.220 --> 21:31.620
Good day.

21:34.290 --> 21:36.100
Oh, Himeko.

21:36.640 --> 21:39.590
Now your heart will be filled with me.

21:40.000 --> 21:44.060
You'll always think of me and
nothing else from now on.

21:44.400 --> 21:46.630
Orochi is darkness.

21:47.170 --> 21:49.569
Since despair's darkness is deep...

21:49.570 --> 21:52.570
it can't stop itself
from destroying the world.

21:53.080 --> 21:55.509
Devours everything it desires...

21:55.510 --> 21:58.740
and consumes it into a bottomless hell.

21:59.620 --> 22:02.690
A place that can never be escaped.

22:03.120 --> 22:05.180
A world of darkness.

22:10.050 --> 22:11.720
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.723 --> 22:13.720
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.723 --> 22:15.535
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.536 --> 22:17.349
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.350 --> 22:20.940
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:20.943 --> 22:22.460
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.461 --> 22:23.979
At least... yes, only now

22:23.980 --> 22:26.360
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.363 --> 22:28.360
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.363 --> 22:32.030
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.033 --> 22:33.620
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.623 --> 22:35.830
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.831 --> 22:38.039
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.040 --> 22:40.375
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.376 --> 22:42.709
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.710 --> 22:45.650
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.651 --> 22:48.589
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.590 --> 22:50.635
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.636 --> 22:52.680
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.510 --> 22:54.930
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:54.931 --> 22:56.349
Just by being by my side

22:56.350 --> 22:58.165
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.166 --> 22:59.979
Just by remaining in the same time as me

22:59.980 --> 23:03.440
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.441 --> 23:06.899
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.900 --> 23:08.880
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.881 --> 23:10.859
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.860 --> 23:12.675
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.676 --> 23:14.489
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.490 --> 23:16.305
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.306 --> 23:18.119
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.120 --> 23:23.645
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.646 --> 23:29.170
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:39.980 --> 23:41.940
Next Time

23:39.980 --> 23:41.900
- Next Time
- Next Time

23:42.140 --> 23:44.819
The sun sets, the moon darkens...

23:44.820 --> 23:48.570
and the tears just endlessly
fall down my cheeks.

23:48.940 --> 23:52.950
I can't catch up even if I run
and can't reach even if I extend my arms.

23:53.360 --> 23:55.620
Yet I still wander about.

23:56.570 --> 23:59.730
Searching for something
that resembles the light.

23:59.731 --> 24:05.920
To the Edge of Hell

24:00.440 --> 24:03.539
Next time on Kannazuki no Miko, episode 9.

24:03.540 --> 24:05.379
To the Edge of Hell.

24:05.380 --> 24:08.710
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
